   "source": [
    "<a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/meizhong986/WhisperJAV/blob/main/notebook/WhisperJAV_kaggle_pass2_only.ipynb\" target=\"_parent\"><img src=\"https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg\" alt=\"Open In Colab\"/></a>\n",
    "<a href=\"https://kaggle.com/kernels/welcome?src=https://github.com/meizhong986/WhisperJAV/blob/main/notebook/WhisperJAV_kaggle_pass2_only.ipynb\" target=\"_parent\"><img src=\"https://kaggle.com/static/images/open-in-kaggle.svg\" alt=\"Open in Kaggle\"/></a>\n",
    "\n",
    "# WhisperJAV Kaggle Pass2-Only Parallel Edition (v1.8.14+)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dual-GPU File-Parallel Workflow (Pass 2 Only)**\n",
    "\n",
    "| Platform | Logic | Storage |\n",
    "|----------|-------|---------|\n",
    "| **Kaggle** | **Parallel Files** (2x T4, each processes different file) | **Input**: `/kaggle/input` (Dataset) <br> **Output**: `/kaggle/working` (Artifacts) |\n",
    "| **Colab** | **Sequential** (1x GPU) | **Input/Output**: Google Drive |\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "### **Key Differences from Standard Notebook**\n",
    "- **Single-Pass Mode**: Only runs **Pass 2** (skips Pass 1 entirely)\n",
    "- **File-Level Parallelism**: Each GPU processes a *different* file, not two passes of the same file\n",
    "- **No Merging**: Output SRT is directly from Pass 2\n",
    "- **Efficiency**: Maximizes throughput for large datasets\n",
    "\n",
    "### **Workflow**\n",
    "1. **Configure**: Select your Pass 2 settings and model preferences.\n",
    "2. **Setup**: Installs dependencies and prepares the environment (**Run Once**).\n",
    "3. **Transcribe**: Processes all video files in parallel using Pass 2 only.\n",
    "\n",
    "<small><i>Tip: Select your Dataset in Kaggle, then use \"Run All\". The notebook is designed to Fail Fast if resources are missing.</i></small>\n",
    "\n",
    "> **HuggingFace token (for `qwen` and other gated models)**: if Pass 2 uses `qwen` (or any gated HF model), set `HF_TOKEN` before running:\n",
    "> 1. **Kaggle**: Add-ons -> Secrets -> Add `HF_TOKEN` with your token (https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens), enable for the notebook, then re-run.\n",
    "> 2. **Colab**: open the left sidebar key icon -> Add `HF_TOKEN` and toggle \"Notebook access\".\n",
    "> Without a token, HF Hub may rate-limit downloads or refuse access to gated repos. Pass 2 will fail with a \"sending unauthenticated requests\" warning followed by a download error.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "<sub>If you find WhisperJAV useful, consider supporting the project: <a href=\"https://buymeacoffee.com/meizhong\">buymeacoffee.com/meizhong</a></sub>"
   ]
  },
